<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Johnston Industries.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Johnston Industries.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Interstate/Johnson Lane said it downgraded Johnston Industries Inc to neutral from buy, citing disappointing first-quarter earnings and a management change.</p>
<p>-- The stock was off 3/8 to seven.</p>
